WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
At seven, the business closes.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.300
But the customers? They're just getting started.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.300
Close to midnight, someone builds herself a quote for an event.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.500
At two in the morning, someone asks, and gets an answer.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.700
And you? Asleep.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.800
At six thirty, someone has already chosen you.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.500
And in the morning, they're waiting for you.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.100
A website that doesn't close at seven.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.000
HG Studio.
